step The Forgotten Coast
  tip Keep riding west to the coast. The Coast Crawl Deepseers and Snapclaws on the beaches drop OOX-22/FE's distress beacon about one kill in forty: if one drops, use it to start the quest.
  collect 8705 "OOX-22/FE Distress Beacon" optional
  accept 2766 optional

step Feralas
  zone Feralas
  goto 53.4,55.7 "Feralas"

step Homing Robot OOX-22/FE
  tip Only with the distress beacon: the robot sits in a small cave on the north side of Feral Scar Vale. Escort it to the dock on the Forgotten Coast; yetis and gorillas ambush you on the way. Its reward waits in Booty Bay for a later visit.
  tip Careful: Three ambushes spawn during the escort, and the robot warns you before each one. The first is 3 yetis, just after the robot leaves the cave and climbs toward the road. The second is 3 gorillas, on the path that runs along the cliff. The third is about 4 gnolls, one of them a caster, where the route turns off toward the dock.
  turnin 2766 optional
  accept 2767 optional
  complete 2767 optional

